OL,3,GNEWSAOrganisations contemplate
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage effects
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses, pharmacists and technology
OL,7,Fexperts in Devon and Cornwall have been
OL,8,Freflecting on the impact of disruption
OL,9,Fexperienced during a national Microsoft
OL,10,Foutage.
OL,12,FMicrosoft's Teams, Outlook and AI
OL,13,Fsoftware Copilot systems were affected
OL,14,Fin more than 70 countries on Friday,
OL,15,Fwith it taking more than 20 hours to
OL,16,Fsolve. The tech giant said it was
OL,17,Fdeeply sorry, adding it had not been
OL,18,F"related to cyber or AI/agents" and was
OL,19,Fthe result of an "earlier network
OL,20,Fcapacity upgrade".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
