OL,3,GNEWSAOrganisations contemplate
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage effects
OL,5,
OL,6,FNick Kaye, a superintendent pharmacist
OL,7,Fin Newquay, Cornwall, said the outage
OL,8,Fshowed how important "face-to-face"
OL,9,Fcare was.
OL,11,F"Technology is great, it definitely
OL,12,Fimproves efficiency but it definitely
OL,13,Fimproves reliance as well and therefore
OL,14,Fweaknesses.
